('advanced-native-011', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-011-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It made Ella less independent overall."],"options":["It was harmful only because the answers were incorrect.","It made Ella less independent overall.","It caused Ella a physical injury.","It helped Ella learn without any drawbacks."]},"advanced-native-011-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["He needs a chance to spot his own mistakes.","Doing everything for him could do more harm than good.","I want to help him learn to work independently.","He might rely on me instead of learning the skill."],"options":["He needs a chance to spot his own mistakes.","Doing everything for him could do more harm than good.","I want to help him learn to work independently.","He might rely on me instead of learning the skill."]},"advanced-native-011-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The extra practice may do more harm than good."],"options":["The plan cannot affect her performance.","The extra practice may do more harm than good.","The practice has only brought benefits."]},"advanced-native-011-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A quiet study group helps everyone understand the work and causes no problems."],"options":["Repeated reminders make a nervous speaker panic and forget her notes.","A shortcut saves five minutes but regularly loses important files.","A quiet study group helps everyone understand the work and causes no problems."]},"advanced-native-011-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["That could do more harm than good. Could you speak to him privately instead?"],"options":["I would wait until the group has finished the project before raising any of the problems.","That could do more harm than good. Could you speak to him privately instead?","Correcting every mistake publicly is the best way to help him improve."]},"advanced-native-011-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Constant interruptions may do more harm than good. Let her finish the song first.","Your advice could do