('advanced-native-012', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-012-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It is demanding but manageable with support."],"options":["It is demanding but manageable with support.","It has already become too much for the students to manage.","Its difficulty guarantees that everyone will improve.","The students have no time or support."]},"advanced-native-012-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Talk to your manager if the workload feels too heavy.","Check whether you have enough support and time to recover.","Notice whether the challenge helps you learn or stops you functioning.","There is a difference between being stretched and being crushed; ask for help if you cannot cope."],"options":["Talk to your manager if the workload feels too heavy.","Check whether you have enough support and time to recover.","Notice whether the challenge helps you learn or stops you functioning.","There is a difference between being stretched and being crushed; ask for help if you cannot cope."]},"advanced-native-012-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The contrast illustrates being stretched and being crushed."],"options":["Both students are simply adjusting to a challenge they can handle.","Only the amount of work matters; support makes no difference.","The contrast illustrates being stretched and being crushed."]},"advanced-native-012-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The phrase means that all pressure is equally harmful."],"options":["The phrase means that all pressure is equally harmful.","A demanding task can help someone develop.","Too much pressure can overwhelm someone."]},"advanced-native-012-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["There is a difference between being stretched and being crushed. Do you have the support you need?"],"options":["If anything is difficult, it must already be crushing you.","Because you are learning, the workload cannot be too much.","There is a difference between being stretched and being crushed. Do you have the support you